# (AI-assisted) the end of the game: Gol and Maia's robot (finalboss-fight) forced into its last
# phase (robotboss-yellow-dark-bomb), its white eco and Daxter movies, the white eco 'picked up'
# (event), the sage movies, the credits (x held: fast-forward), the 100-cell movie, the final door
# (target-final-door) and the secret ending, then back to the title (target-title-wait).
# finalboss-movies (task 112) status goes 1 -> 3 -> 4 -> 5 -> 6 -> 0. About 15 min on the host.
#   OPENGOAL_NO_SOUND=1 OPENGOAL_PAD_SCRIPT=<this file> build-host-small/game/gk --proj-path <proj>
#     --config-path <scratch dir> --ctr-gfx -- -boot -fakeiso -nosound -cbackend
# (host small-memory C-mode gk running the p3ds modules; --config-path keeps the saves out of
# the user's OpenGOAL folder). Format and commands: game/sce/pad_script.h
0 wait *target* target-title-wait
200 continue finalboss-fight
201 wait *target* target-continue
440 pos *target*
441 pstate robotboss
460 call poke32 $*game-info* 92 f100
470 call pgo robotboss robotboss-yellow-dark-bomb
600 pstate robotboss
600 pstate sage-finalboss
600 pos *target*
600 call get-task-status 112
